  "raw_meta_yaml": "context:\n  version: \"5.4.0\"\n\npackage:\n  name: esptool\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://pypi.org/packages/source/e/esptool/esptool-${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: fd756598db0a26c9975fa18511b08687c54bf2ce7322ede80cf1f5117dad1f50\n\nbuild:\n  script: python -m pip install . -vv\n  number: 0\n  python:\n    entry_points:\n      - esptool = esptool.__init__:_main\n      - espsecure = espsecure.__init__:_main\n      - espefuse = espefuse.__init__:_main\n      - esp_rfc2217_server = esp_rfc2217_server.__init__:main\n      - if: win\n        then:\n          - esptool.py = esptool.__init__:_main\n          - espsecure.py = espsecure.__init__:_main\n          - espefuse.py = espefuse.__init__:_main\n          - esp_rfc2217_server.py = esp_rfc2217_server.__init__:main\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - if: build_platform != target_platform\n      then:\n        - cross-python_${{ target_platform }}\n        - python\n  host:\n    - pip\n    - python\n    - setuptools >=64\n  run:\n    - bitstring >=3.1.6,!=4.2.0\n    - click <9\n    - cryptography >=43.0.0\n    - esp-pylib >=1.0.0\n    - intelhex\n    - python\n    - pyserial >=3.3\n    - pyyaml >=5.1\n    - reedsolo >=1.5.3,<1.8\n    - rich-click <2\n\ntests:\n  - python:\n      imports:\n        - esptool\n      pip_check: true\n  - script:\n      - esptool -h\n      - espsecure -h\n      - espefuse -h\n      - esptool.py -h\n      - espsecure.py -h\n      - espefuse.py -h\n      - esp_rfc2217_server.py -h\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://github.com/espressif/esptool\n  summary: 'A serial utility for flashing, provisioning, and interacting with Espressif SoCs.'\n  license: GPL-2.0-or-later\n  license_file: LICENSE\n  documentation: https://docs.espressif.com/projects/esptool/\n  repository: https://github.com/espressif/esptool\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - m-rossi\n",
